  [<TIME>] INFO       Names: alpha
  [<TIME>] DEBUG    PBS S3 endpoint restore: current s3-endpoints=3 names=alpha,beta,gamma
  [<TIME>] DEBUG    PBS S3 endpoint restore: s3-endpoint=beta not in backup action=remove
  [<TIME>] DEBUG    PBS S3 endpoint restore: s3-endpoint=beta remove failed error="injected remove failure"
  [<TIME>] INFO     S3 endpoint beta is configured on this PBS but not present in the backup
  [<TIME>] WARNING  ⚠ PBS S3 endpoint beta: not removed
  [<TIME>] DEBUG    PBS S3 endpoint restore: s3-endpoint=gamma not in backup action=remove
