  [<TIME>] INFO     ✓ PBS S3 endpoint gamma: removed
  [<TIME>] DEBUG    PBS S3 endpoint restore: s3-endpoint=alpha created
  [<TIME>] INFO     ✓ PBS S3 endpoint alpha: applied
  [<TIME>] WARNING  ⚠ PBS S3 endpoint configuration: partially applied

